 "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oesc_6qi3l0Q7kNvwFQjX4P&_nc_oc=AdkcSeWphXY3tlMlAH8Fd4VfKLh0hLOsVfcAHuNLqF07qDE-J21Z1Pe7XWTuYiGJXFY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwo_VWXpqi07VX-bKoTuQt7iztO3DjYP5Kk_RdiGS21sQ&oe=69B29EB9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9ENbcM1LbjcQ7kNvwE0bnOT&_nc_oc=Adknb8RnNikrMD4j1Wkkx89f7qh7Z9BUNQFZNwmcqMg-5s1RN3nGg1f5RFMCIl-LbXg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxX3pap1OcKpRst8b-jY-o3Gk1bfg-FFLEwG1S-DfhsTQ&oe=69B2AE53"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LB6vkdYbjkwQ7kNvwESZQ9H&_nc_oc=AdkRLOEcINue4qnO2gK1TDeDwBl8ThOCzHZch1XmbG7XYycsb2btM12y4BxdijAtJsk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzb7BB7QpTN6iy6SUj3zvZzJ3Lk0vSih7f05kiRegukKw&oe=69B2B9FB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mZt2jujFfJUQ7kNvwFKbAHG&_nc_oc=AdkNIgSnF2DAjjx0kU8M-A2xew1j-8QO3VSFDcUzoyOn6k2_CDK-WeGQsOtBIixWnoM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxenMXX5uA0YneqKbjwm2Fy6AkM9qRFI2d-4jmaiR9K4w&oe=69B2BB4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b72zF8AJ8-cQ7kNvwHl6Zj0&_nc_oc=AdkgVIUq8dUgg89PveAAHtBAfGslaDzD6DGkDN66F14wXTsfolHYdwuO9TBGnPperDg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxTEIbxFJTe0p_Q8YI5WyCqwUvkbVOl350BCvd5TScHFg&oe=69B2A47E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aerodrums", "supp